# Customer follow-up system

## Overview
An automated customer follow-up workflow that captures incoming form submissions,
logs them and sends timed confirmation and follow up emails without manual tracking

## Problem
Manually tracking new customer/lead submissions and remembering to send timely
follow-ups is time-consuming and easy to drop. Delayed for missed follow-ups means
lost engagement and lost business

## Solution
This workflow automatically:
1. Watches for new Google Form responses
2. Logs each response as a new row in Google Sheets
3. Sends an initial confirmation email via Gmail
4. Waits for a set period
5. Sends a follow-up email via Gmail
6. Updates the Google Sheet row to mark the follow-up as sent

## Tools
- Make.com
- Googlr Forms
- Google Sheets
- Gmail

## Outcome
Estimated time saved:
~168 hrs/years
~14 hrs/month
~3.2 hrs/weekly

